<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - Credit Saison raised to &quot;1&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Credit Saison raised to &quot;1&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nikko Research Center Ltd raised the rating of Credit Saison Co Ltd to a &quot;1&quot; rating from &quot;2&quot;, Nikko Securities brokers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute gives a &quot;1&quot; rating to issues whose values it sees outperforming the key 225-share Nikkei average by more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
<p>Credit Saison is a leading consumer credit firm.</p>
</text>
